
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@customerA = demo-customer-a
@customerB = demo-customer-b
@merchantA = demo-merchant-a
@merchantB = demo-merchant-b

### 准备：应用建表后执行 scripts/order-query-demo.sql，客户和商家查询同一 order 资源。
### 客户甲：501、502、504，data.page.total=3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/page
Authorization: Bearer {{customerA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"options":{"page":1,"limit":20}}

### 客户甲按商家甲筛选：501、504，total=2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/page
Authorization: Bearer {{customerA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"options":{"filter":{"merchantId":1001},"page":1,"limit":20}}

### 商家甲：501、503、504，total=3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/page
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"options":{"page":1,"limit":20}}

### 商家甲按客户甲筛选：501、504，total=2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/page
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"options":{"filter":{"customerId":301}}}

### 客户乙：503、505，total=2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/page
Authorization: Bearer {{customerB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 商家乙：502、505，total=2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/page
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 客户甲第二页：502，total=3；框架缺省按创建时间、主键倒序
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/page
Authorization: Bearer {{customerA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"options":{"page":2,"limit":1}}

### 无计数分页：返回订单值字段，totalKnown=false
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/page
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"options":{"page":1,"limit":1,"countMode":"NONE"}}

### 客户甲读取本人订单值字段，不加载客户和明细
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{customerA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":501}

### 商家甲读取同一订单值字段
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":501}

### 商家甲跨归属详情：404；相同条件 findOne 返回 data.item=null（默认空字段省略）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":502}

### 客户甲试图指定其他客户归属：403，FILTER 未授予当前归属字段
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/page
Authorization: Bearer {{customerA}}
X-Customer-Id: 302
X-Access-Entry: merchant
Content-Type: application/json

{"options":{"filter":{"customerId":302}}}

### 仅伪造 Header：仍只返回客户甲的订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/page
Authorization: Bearer {{customerA}}
X-Customer-Id: 302
X-Access-Entry: merchant
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 缺少凭证：403，旧 local-developer 演示主体不再授予订单读取权限
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/page
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 显式展开客户和明细：仅返回授权字段，客户邮箱不开放
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{customerA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":501,"options":{"expandRelations":["customer","orderItemList"]}}

### 商家甲按同一接口读取订单明细成交快照
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":501,"options":{"expandRelations":["orderItemList"]}}

### 嵌套展开仍拒绝：403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{customerA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":501,"options":{"expandRelations":["customer.address"]}}
